README.md
    1→# Bubble Tea
    10→The fun, functional and stateful way to build terminal apps. A Go framework
    11→based on [The Elm Architecture][elm]. Bubble Tea is well-suited for simple and
    12→complex terminal applications, either inline, full-window, or a mix of both.
